THE HTTP HALF IS STILL NOT RUN and has never run. Checked once more at
2026-09-23T10:12:18Z: curl (56) CONNECT tunnel failed, response 403. That is
an egress policy on this box, it is the founder's to change, and it is not
retryable.

A NOTE ON WHERE THE GRANT VERDICTS CAME FROM. Every privilege reading behind
this probe and behind migration 20260923101038 is taken from the CATALOGUE:
pg_proc.proacl and has_function_privilege. None of it is from
information_schema.role_table_grants or information_schema.column_privileges,
which only return rows where the querying role is grantor or grantee, so an
empty result from those views is a fact about the observer and not about the
object.

